<!DOCTYPE html>
<!-- ============================================================================
     项目详情 · 运维（`工作-项目-项目详情-运维-index.html`）
     ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
     ✅ **已落地**（2026-09-25）。它是项目详情「运维」分区的界面，
        实现在 `src/components/workspace/project-detail/OpsPanel.tsx`，
        样式在 `src/styles/module-workspace.css` 的「项目详情 · 运维」段。

     ⚠️ 它比它之前那一版（`work_product-detail.html` 里的"三张卡 + 几行"）多了五件东西：
        **KPI 指标条**（含"环境健康"那一格）、**服务器行带 CPU/MEM/DISK 负载表** +
        展开后的五个子分区（信息 / 监控 / 日志 / 部署 / 文件分布）、监控迷你折线、
        目录占用、发布记录的筛选与逐条展开。

     ⚠️ 落地时改掉的六处（都写在 `OpsPanel.tsx` 的文件头，别照抄回去）：
        ① 从原型搬来的规则**多收一层 `.ops-page`** —— 概览卡片与运维分区共用
           `.server-row` / `.deploy-row` 这一批类名，而两边版式不同；
        ② "最后检查 / 刷新"这一行搬进分区内部（这一页的页头是共用的可折叠 Hero）；
        ③ 日志子分区**不跳页**：应用里还没有那一页，它诚实地回一句"还没落地"；
        ④ 停机的那台不显示负载（meter 0 + 「—」）；
        ⑤ "环境健康"的判据是**算出来的**（任一负载 ≥ 90%），不是写死在标记里；
        ⑥ 破坏性操作（重启 / 回滚 / 清理）**确认之后只给回执** —— 没有那些接口。

     ⚠️ 这个原型**只有亮色**（`.dark` 块里只有它自己的壳令牌）。这一页的颜色全部走应用的
        令牌（`--mw-ok/warn/danger` 与原型的 `--ok-fg` 等**逐个对过值**，同值即并过去），
        所以不需要另写一批暗色变体。
     ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- -->
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>运维 · 项目详情</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

        /* [hidden] 必须始终生效 —— 否则会被 .skeleton-list / .empty-state 的 display:flex 覆盖 */
        [hidden] { display: none !important; }

        :root {
            --bg-page: #F7F8FA;
            --bg-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            --bg-card-solid: #FFFFFF;
            --bg-sidebar: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            --bg-topbar: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
            --border-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
            --border-subtle: rgba(15,23,42,0.07);
            --border-strong: rgba(15,23,42,0.12);
            --text-primary: #0F172A;
            /* 浅色主题下二级/三级文字必须 ≥4.5:1 */
            --text-secondary: #4A5A72;   /* 6.6:1 on #F7F8FA */
            --text-muted: #5B6A82;       /* 5.2:1 on #F7F8FA */
            --shadow-card: 0 4px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.05);
            --shadow-card-hover: 0 8px 32px rgba(15,23,42,0.10);
            --blur-card: blur(28px) saturate(200%);
            --blob-opacity: 0.42;
            --blob-blur: 120px;

            --r-sm: 8px; --r-md: 12px; --r-lg: 18px; --r-xl: 22px;
            --s-1: 4px; --s-2: 8px; --s-3: 12px; --s-4: 16px; --s-5: 20px;

            --a-work-1: #FDA4AF; --a-work-2: #FECDD3; --a-work-3: #FBCFE8;
            --s-work: #E11D48;
            --m1: var(--a-work-1); --m2: var(--a-work-2); --m3: var(--a-work-3);
            --m-main: var(--s-work);

            /* 运维模块功能色 */
            --rc: #10B981;
            --rc-book: #10B981;

            /* 语义状态令牌（浅色）—— 全部 ≥4.5:1 对比度 */
            --ok-fg: #047857;      --ok-bg: rgba(16,185,129,0.14);
            --warn-fg: #9A4708;    --warn-bg: rgba(245,158,11,0.16);
            --danger-fg: #B91C1C;  --danger-bg: rgba(239,68,68,0.13);
            --idle-fg: #475569;    --idle-bg: rgba(100,116,139,0.16);

            /* 图表/进度色块（非文本，需 ≥3:1） */
            --bar-ok: #10B981;
            --bar-warn: #F59E0B;
            --bar-danger: #EF4444;
            --bar-track: rgba(15,23,42,0.09);

            --focus-ring: var(--text-primary);
        }

        .dark {
            --bg-page: #0A0F1C;
            --bg-card: rgba(30,41,59,0.5);
            --bg-card-solid: #1E293B;
            --bg-sidebar: rgba(15,23,42,0.78);
            --bg-topbar: rgba(15,23,42,0.78);
            --border-card: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            --border-subtle: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            --border-strong: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
            --text-primary: #F1F5F9;
            --text-secondary: #94A3B8;
            --text-muted: #8695AB;
            --shadow-card: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            --shadow-card-hover: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.42);
            --blur-card: blur(32px) saturate(180%);
            --blob-opacity: 0.26;
            --blob-blur: 140px;

            --a-work-1: #BE123C; --a-work-2: #9F1239; --a-work-3: #881337;
            --s-work: #FB7185;
            --rc: #34D399;
            /* 书脊用更深的祖母绿：深色底上亮薄荷绿会显得发飘 */
            --rc-book: #059669;

            --ok-fg: #6EE7B7;      --ok-bg: rgba(16,185,129,0.20);
            --warn-fg: #FCD34D;    --warn-bg: rgba(245,158,11,0.22);
            --danger-fg: #FCA5A5;  --danger-bg: rgba(239,68,68,0.22);
            --idle-fg: #CBD5E1;    --idle-bg: rgba(148,163,184,0.22);

            --bar-ok: #34D399;
            --bar-warn: #FBBF24;
            --bar-danger: #F87171;
            --bar-track: rgba(255,255,255,0.13);
        }

        html, body {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: -apple-system, "SF Pro Display", "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            background: var(--bg-page);
            transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* 焦点环：用主文本色，浅/深色底与彩色底上都可见 */
        :focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid var(--focus-ring);
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .sr-only {
            position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px;
            overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0;
        }

        /* 极光 */
        .aurora-bg { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 0; overflow: hidden; pointer-events: none; }
        .blob { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(var(--blob-blur)); opacity: var(--blob-opacity); animation: drift 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate; }
        .blob-1 { width: 600px; height: 600px; top: -12%; left: -10%; background: var(--m1); }
        .blob-2 { width: 540px; height: 540px; top: 20%; right: -14%; background: var(--m2); animation-delay: -7s; }
        .blob-3 { width: 620px; height: 620px; bottom: -20%; left: 26%; background: var(--m3); animation-delay: -14s; }
        @keyframes drift { from { transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); } to { transform: translate(50px,-40px) scale(1.12); } }

        .app {
            position: relative; z-index: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
            grid-template-rows: 56px 1fr;
            grid-template-areas: "sidebar topbar" "sidebar main";
            height: 100vh;
        }

        /* 侧栏 */
        .sidebar {
            grid-area: sidebar;
            background: var(--bg-sidebar);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border-right: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            padding: 16px 12px;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .sidebar-title { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); padding: 14px 12px 6px; }
        .menu-item {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer; border-left: 3px solid transparent;
            transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease; user-select: none;
        }
        .menu-item:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-primary); }
        .menu-item.active { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 12%, transparent); color: var(--m-main); border-left-color: var(--m-main); font-weight: 600; }
        .menu-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--m-main); flex-shrink: 0; }

        /* 移动端抽屉 */
        .drawer-mask {
            position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 110;
            background: rgba(15,23,42,0.42);
            backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
            opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
            transition: opacity 0.25s ease;
        }
        body.drawer-open .drawer-mask { opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
        .hamburger {
            display: none;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-primary);
            font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;
        }

        /* 顶栏 */
        .topbar {
            grid-area: topbar;
            background: var(--bg-topbar);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 0 24px; gap: 16px;
        }
        .breadcrumb { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
        .breadcrumb a { color: var(--text-muted); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
        .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--m-main); }
        .breadcrumb strong { color: var(--text-primary); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
        .topbar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }

        .btn {
            border: none; border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            font-family: inherit; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--m-main); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 30%, transparent); }
        .btn-primary:hover { box-shadow: 0 6px 20px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 50%, transparent); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .btn-ghost { background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--text-primary); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
        .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--m-main); color: var(--m-main); }
        .btn-danger { background: var(--danger-fg); color: #fff; }
        .btn-danger:hover { filter: brightness(1.08); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .btn-sm { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
        .theme-toggle {
            width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            cursor: pointer; font-size: 16px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            transition: transform 0.18s ease, border-color 0.18s ease;
        }
        .theme-toggle:hover { transform: scale(1.05); border-color: var(--m-main); }

        /* 主区 */
        .main {
            grid-area: main;
            padding: 24px 28px 60px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            overscroll-behavior: contain;
        }

        .detail {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .p-rose { --c: #E11D48; }

        /* ============================================================
           项目详情头部
           ============================================================ */
        .hero-mini { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .hero-mini-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .hero-mini-tag {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px;
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--c) 14%, transparent);
            color: var(--c);
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .hero-mini-name { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
        .hero-mini-back { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: color 0.18s ease; }
        .hero-mini-back:hover { color: var(--m-main); }
        .hero-mini-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .last-sync { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap; }

        /* Tab 导航 */
        .tabs-wrap {
            position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-page) 62%, transparent 100%);
            padding: 4px 0 10px;
            margin-bottom: -6px;
        }
        .tabs {
            display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto;
            padding: 6px; border-radius: var(--r-md);
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .tab {
            flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
            padding: 9px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer; transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
            white-space: nowrap; user-select: none;
            border: none; background: transparent; font-family: inherit;
        }
        .tab:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: var(--border-subtle); }
        .tab.active { background: var(--m-main); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--m-main) 35%, transparent); }
        .tab .tab-count {
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-muted); min-width: 18px; text-align: center;
        }
        .tab.active .tab-count { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); color: #fff; }

        /* ============================================================
           KPI 指标条
           ============================================================ */
        .kpi-bar { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
        .kpi {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: var(--r-lg);
            padding: 14px 16px 15px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
        }
        .kpi::before {
            content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px;
            background: var(--kpi-accent, var(--rc)); opacity: 0.85;
        }
        .kpi:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover); transform: translateY(-2px); }
        .kpi.warn { --kpi-accent: var(--bar-warn); }
        .kpi-top { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .kpi-ico { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1; }
        .kpi-label { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .kpi-val { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .kpi-unit { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-left: 4px; }
        .kpi-sub { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
        .kpi-sub.warn-text { color: var(--warn-fg); font-weight: 600; }

        /* ============================================================
           通用卡片 / 折叠
           ============================================================ */
        .ops-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            backdrop-filter: var(--blur-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
            border-radius: var(--r-lg);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }
        .ops-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-card-hover); }

        .ops-card-head {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            cursor: pointer; user-select: none;
            transition: background 0.18s ease;
        }
        .ops-card-head:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); }
        .ops-card-head-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-width: 0; }
        .ops-card-head-left .card-icon {
            width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: var(--r-sm);
            background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc) 14%, transparent);
            color: var(--rc);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .ops-card-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
        .ops-card-badge {
            font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 600;
            padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--border-subtle); margin-left: 2px; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .ops-card-head-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .ops-fold-icon {
            width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1);
        }
        .ops-card.collapsed .ops-fold-icon { transform: rotate(-90deg); }

        /* 折叠：grid-template-rows 0fr/1fr —— 内容永不被裁 */
        .ops-card-body {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-rows: 1fr;
            transition: grid-template-rows 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .ops-card.collapsed .ops-card-body { grid-template-rows: 0fr; opacity: 0; }
        .ops-card-body > .ops-card-body-inner { overflow: hidden; min-height: 0; }
        .ops-card-body-inner { padding: 18px 18px 20px; }

        /* ============================================================
           服务器
           ============================================================ */
        .server-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr) auto auto;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
            position: relative;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }
        .server-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .server-row:hover { border-color: var(--rc); transform: translateX(2px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
        .server-row.active { border-color: var(--rc); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc) 6%, var(--bg-card)); }
        .server-row.alert { border-left: 3px solid var(--bar-warn); }

        .server-rack {
            width: 28px; height: 36px; border-radius: 6px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #475569 0%, #334155 100%);
            position: relative; flex-shrink: 0;
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
        }
        .server-rack::before {
            content: ""; position: absolute; top: 6px; left: 4px; right: 4px; height: 2px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); border-radius: 1px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.25), 0 12px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
        }
        .server-rack.prod { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #EF4444 0%, #B91C1C 100%); }
        .server-rack.test { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #06B6D4 0%, #0891B2 100%); }

        .server-info { min-width: 0; }
        .server-name {
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
            margin-bottom: 3px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .server-meta { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* 状态徽标 —— 统一语义令牌 */
        .badge {
            font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px;
            flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        }
        .badge.ok { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .badge.warn { background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .badge.danger { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-fg); }
        .badge.idle { background: var(--idle-bg); color: var(--idle-fg); }

        .env-tag {
            font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* 迷你资源条 */
        .server-meters { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: center; }
        .meter { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
        .meter-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
        .meter-track { display: block; width: 64px; height: 5px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bar-track); overflow: hidden; }
        .meter-fill { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bar-ok); transition: width 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1); }
        .meter-fill.warn { background: var(--bar-warn); }
        .meter-fill.danger { background: var(--bar-danger); }
        .meter-val { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text-secondary); min-width: 30px; text-align: right; }
        .meter-val.warn { color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .meter-val.danger { color: var(--danger-fg); }

        .server-actions { display: flex; gap: 4px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s ease; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .server-row:hover .server-actions, .server-row:focus-within .server-actions { opacity: 1; }
        .server-action-btn {
            width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: var(--bg-card-solid);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; font-family: inherit;
            transition: border-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
        }
        .server-action-btn:hover { border-color: var(--rc); color: var(--rc); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc) 8%, transparent); }
        .server-action-btn.danger:hover { border-color: var(--bar-danger); color: var(--danger-fg); background: var(--danger-bg); }

        /* 行内详情面板 */
        .server-detail-panel {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-rows: 0fr;
            opacity: 0;
            margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;
            transition: grid-template-rows 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1), opacity 0.28s ease, margin 0.38s ease;
            border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--bg-card-solid);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .server-detail-panel.open {
            grid-template-rows: 1fr;
            opacity: 1;
            margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px;
            border-color: var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .server-detail-panel > .server-detail-inner { overflow: hidden; min-height: 0; }
        .server-detail-inner { padding: 14px 16px; }

        /* ============================================================
           详情面板内的一排按钮组（分区切换）
           ============================================================ */
        .sd-tabs {
            display: flex; gap: 3px;
            padding: 3px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            background: var(--border-subtle);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            overflow-x: auto;
            scrollbar-width: none;
        }
        .sd-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
        .sd-tab {
            flex: 1 1 auto;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
            padding: 7px 12px;
            border: none; background: transparent;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-family: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
        }
        /* 跳到独立页面的分区，用模块绿提示「会离开本页」 */
        .sd-tab.ext { color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .sd-tab.ext:hover { color: var(--rc); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc) 8%, transparent); }
        .sd-tab.ext .sd-tab-count { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .sd-tab:hover { color: var(--text-primary); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-card-solid) 55%, transparent); }
        .sd-tab.active {
            background: var(--bg-card-solid);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), inset 0 -2px 0 var(--rc);
        }
        .sd-tab-count {
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800;
            padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-muted);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }
        .sd-tab.active .sd-tab-count { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok-fg); }

        .sd-pane { display: none; }
        .sd-pane.active { display: block; animation: paneIn 0.26s ease; }
        @keyframes paneIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

        /* 面板内小节 */
        .sd-section + .sd-section { margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle); }
        .sd-section-head {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px;
            font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .sd-section-head .hint { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; }

        /* ============ 信息 ============ */
        .server-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 12px 14px; }
        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            .server-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        }
        .detail-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; min-width: 0; }
        .detail-label {
            font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .detail-value {
            font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
            color: var(--text-primary); word-break: break-word;
        }
        .detail-value .mono-sub { font-weight: 400; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .usage-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px 20px; }
        @media (min-width: 1024px) {
            .usage-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
        }
        .usage-item { min-width: 0; }
        .usage-top { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .usage-top .name { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary); flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
        .usage-top .val { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text-primary); flex: 0 0 auto; }
        .usage-top .val.warn { color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .usage-top .val.danger { color: var(--danger-fg); }
        .usage-item .meter-track { display: block; width: 100%; height: 6px; }

        /* ============ 监控 ============ */
        .metric-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
        .metric-card {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 11px 12px 9px;
            background: var(--bg-card);
        }
        .metric-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .metric-name { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .metric-now { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .metric-now.warn { color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .metric-now.danger { color: var(--danger-fg); }
        .spark { display: block; width: 100%; height: 36px; }
        .spark .spark-axis { stroke: var(--border-strong); stroke-width: 1; }
        .spark .spark-area { fill: var(--bar-ok); fill-opacity: 0.13; stroke: none; }
        .spark .spark-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--bar-ok); stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linejoin: round; stroke-linecap: round; }
        .spark.warn .spark-area { fill: var(--bar-warn); }
        .spark.warn .spark-line { stroke: var(--bar-warn); }
        .spark.danger .spark-area { fill: var(--bar-danger); }
        .spark.danger .spark-line { stroke: var(--bar-danger); }
        .spark-foot {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 6px; font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--text-muted);
            font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        }

        .kv-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(118px, 1fr)); gap: 11px 16px; }
        .kv { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
        .kv-k { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .kv-v { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .kv-v small { font-weight: 500; font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .kv-v.warn { color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .kv-v.danger { color: var(--danger-fg); }

        /* ============ 部署 ============ */
        .mini-timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }
        .mini-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
            padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px;
            transition: background 0.15s ease;
        }
        .mini-row:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); }
        .mini-dot {
            width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
            background: var(--dc);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--dc) 22%, transparent);
        }
        .mini-ver {
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; min-width: 56px;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
        }
        .mini-note {
            flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0;
            font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted);
            overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .mini-time { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; flex-shrink: 0; }

        /* ============ 文件分布 ============ */
        .disk-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 11px; }
        .disk-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 92px; gap: 4px 12px; align-items: center; }
        .disk-path {
            grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1;
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);
            overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .disk-size { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text-secondary); text-align: right; }
        .disk-bar { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; display: block; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bar-track); overflow: hidden; }
        .disk-bar > span { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--bar-ok); }
        .disk-bar > span.warn { background: var(--bar-warn); }
        .disk-bar > span.danger { background: var(--bar-danger); }
        .disk-pct { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: right; }
        .disk-total {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 13px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
            font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-secondary);
        }
        .disk-total strong { font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-primary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

        /* ============ 提示条 ============ */
        .note {
            display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start;
            padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 9px;
            font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6;
            background: var(--warn-bg); color: var(--warn-fg);
        }
        .note.ok { background: var(--ok-bg); color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .note.danger { background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-fg); }
        .note-ico { flex-shrink: 0; font-weight: 800; }
        .note strong { font-weight: 800; }

        /* ============ 面板底部动作行 ============ */
        .sd-actions {
            display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 12px;
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
        }

        /* 骨架屏 */
        .skeleton-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
        .sk-row {
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
            padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
            background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .sk { position: relative; overflow: hidden; background: var(--bar-track); border-radius: 6px; }
        .sk::after {
            content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-muted) 22%, transparent), transparent);
            animation: shimmer 1.2s infinite;
        }
        @keyframes shimmer { from { transform: translateX(-100%); } to { transform: translateX(100%); } }
        .sk-box { width: 28px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        .sk-lines { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
        .sk-line { height: 10px; width: 42%; }
        .sk-line.short { width: 68%; height: 8px; }
        .sk-meter { width: 200px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }

        /* ============================================================
           部署文档（书架）
           ============================================================ */
        .doc-books { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; }
        .doc-books.compact .doc-book { width: 104px; height: 136px; padding: 10px 10px 10px 16px; }
        .doc-books.compact .doc-book:nth-child(2) { height: 128px; }
        .doc-books.compact .doc-book:nth-child(3) { height: 132px; }
        .doc-book {
            position: relative; overflow: hidden;
            --spine-base: linear-gradient(145deg,
            color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc-book) 90%, white) 0%,
            var(--rc-book) 45%,
            color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc-book) 70%, black) 100%);
            /* 上层是底部护底渐变（scrim）：书脊保持鲜艳，文字区单独压暗保证可读 */
            background:
                    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0) 24%, rgba(0,0,0,0.16) 52%, rgba(0,0,0,0.52) 100%),
                    var(--spine-base);
            box-shadow:
                    inset 3px 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.18),
                    inset -2px 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.22),
                    0 6px 16px rgba(15,23,42,0.16);
            transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.4, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            color: #fff; cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 4px 8px 8px 4px;
            border: none; text-align: left; font-family: inherit;
        }
        .doc-book:hover { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(-1.5deg); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2), inset -2px 0 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.28), 0 14px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.26); }
        .doc-book::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 8px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.4), rgba(0,0,0,0.15) 50%, transparent); }
        .doc-book::after { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 3px; top: 10%; bottom: 10%; width: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
        .doc-book.script { --spine-base: linear-gradient(145deg, #4B5563 0%, #374151 50%, #1F2937 100%); }
        .dark .doc-book.script { --spine-base: linear-gradient(145deg, #6B7280 0%, #4B5563 50%, #374151 100%); }
        .db-tag {
            font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.34);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.34);
            border-radius: 3px; align-self: flex-start; text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .db-title {
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.3;
            margin-top: auto; margin-bottom: 5px;
            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden;
        }
        .db-meta { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.86); }
        .doc-book .book-actions {
            position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 6px;
            display: flex; gap: 3px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
        }
        .doc-book:hover .book-actions, .doc-book:focus-within .book-actions { opacity: 1; }
        .book-action-btn {
            width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 4px; border: none;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px; font-family: inherit;
            transition: background 0.15s ease;
        }
        .book-action-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
        .doc-book.add {
            background: transparent;
            border: 1.5px dashed var(--border-strong);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            box-shadow: none;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
            font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600;
        }
        .doc-book.add::before, .doc-book.add::after { display: none; }
        .doc-book.add:hover { border-color: var(--rc); color: var(--rc); transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: none; }

        /* ============================================================
           发布记录
           ============================================================ */
        .deploy-toolbar {
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 14px;
        }
        .chip-group { display: flex; gap: 6px; background: var(--border-subtle); padding: 3px; border-radius: 10px; }
        .chip {
            border: none; background: transparent; font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-secondary);
            padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
            transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .chip:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .chip.active { background: var(--bg-card-solid); color: var(--text-primary); box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); }
        .chip-count { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
        .chip.active .chip-count { color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .deploy-filter-info { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        .deploy-timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: relative; }
        .deploy-timeline::before {
            content: ""; position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 14px; bottom: 14px;
            width: 1px; background: var(--border-strong);
        }
        .deploy-entry { display: contents; }
        .deploy-entry[hidden] { display: none; }

        .deploy-row {
            display: flex; gap: 12px;
            padding: 9px 8px 9px 6px;
            border-radius: var(--r-sm);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background 0.15s ease;
            position: relative; margin-bottom: 2px;
        }
        .deploy-row:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); }
        .deploy-row.highlight { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--rc) 7%, transparent); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--rc); }
        .deploy-dot {
            width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0;
            background: var(--dc);
            border: 3px solid var(--bg-card-solid);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb, var(--dc) 34%, transparent);
            margin-top: 3px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        .deploy-row:hover .deploy-dot { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px color-mix(in srgb, var(--dc) 42%, transparent); transform: scale(1.1); }
        .deploy-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
        .deploy-ver { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 3px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .deploy-meta { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .deploy-meta .sep { opacity: 0.45; }
        .deploy-duration {
            font-size: 10.5px; padding: 1px 7px; background: var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 4px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-weight: 600;
        }
        .deploy-expand-icon {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-left: 2px; font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--text-muted); transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .deploy-row.expanded .deploy-expand-icon { transform: rotate(180deg); }

        .deploy-detail-panel {
            display: grid; grid-template-rows: 0fr;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: grid-template-rows 0.38s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1), opacity 0.28s ease, margin 0.38s ease;
            margin-left: 24px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;
            border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg-card-solid);
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .deploy-detail-panel.open { grid-template-rows: 1fr; opacity: 1; margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 8px; border-color: var(--border-subtle); }
        .deploy-detail-panel > .deploy-detail-inner { overflow: hidden; min-height: 0; }
        .deploy-detail-inner { padding: 13px 14px; }
        .deploy-detail-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 10px 14px; }
        .deploy-detail-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
        .deploy-detail-item .label {
            font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .deploy-detail-item .value { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; word-break: break-word; }
        .deploy-detail-item .value.small { font-family: inherit; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }
        .deploy-detail-actions { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

        .empty-state {
            display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px; padding: 36px 20px; text-align: center;
            border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--r-md);
        }
        .empty-icon { font-size: 24px; opacity: 0.6; }
        .empty-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
        .empty-desc { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--text-muted); }

        /* ============================================================
           弹窗 / Toast
           ============================================================ */
        .modal-mask {
            position: fixed; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(15,23,42,0.35);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            z-index: 200;
            display: none;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .modal-mask.open { display: flex; animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease; }
        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
        .modal {
            background: var(--bg-card-solid);
            border-radius: var(--r-lg);
            width: 100%; max-width: 460px;
            max-height: 88vh;
            display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(15,23,42,0.28);
            animation: modalIn 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34,1.56,0.64,1);
        }
        @keyframes modalIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95) translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

        .modal-head { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 18px 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }
        .modal-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; }
        .modal-close {
            width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: var(--r-sm); flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer; color: var(--text-secondary); background: transparent;
            border: none; font-size: 14px; font-family: inherit;
            transition: background 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
        }
        .modal-close:hover { background: var(--border-subtle); color: var(--text-primary); }
        .modal-body { padding: 22px; overflow-y: auto; }
        .modal-body p { font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.75; }
        .modal-warn {
            margin-top: 14px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: var(--r-md);
            background: var(--danger-bg); color: var(--danger-fg);
            font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65;
        }
        .modal-warn.info { background: var(--idle-bg); color: var(--idle-fg); }
        .modal-warn strong { font-weight: 800; margin-right: 2px; }

        .modal-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 16px 22px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); }

        .toast {
            position: fixed; bottom: 24px; left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);
            background: var(--bg-card-solid); color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: var(--r-md);
            box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(15,23,42,0.2);
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; z-index: 300;
            opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            max-width: calc(100vw - 32px);
        }
        .toast.show { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
        .toast[data-type="ok"] { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bar-ok) 40%, transparent); }
        .toast[data-type="warn"] { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bar-warn) 45%, transparent); }
        .toast[data-type="ok"] .toast-ico { color: var(--ok-fg); }
        .toast[data-type="warn"] .toast-ico { color: var(--warn-fg); }
        .toast-ico { font-weight: 800; }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 8px; height: 8px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: transparent; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border-strong); border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--text-muted); }

        /* 触屏：无 hover，常驻操作按钮 */
        @media (hover: none) {
            .server-actions, .book-actions { opacity: 1 !important; }
        }

        /* ============================================================
           响应式
           ============================================================ */
        @media (min-width: 769px) {
            .hamburger, .drawer-mask { display: none !important; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 1180px) {
            .server-meters { display: none; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 980px) {
            .kpi-bar { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-areas: "topbar" "main"; }
            .sidebar {
                position: fixed; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; width: 244px;
                z-index: 120; transform: translateX(-102%);
                transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1);
                box-shadow: 0 0 48px rgba(15,23,42,0.24);
            }
            body.drawer-open .sidebar { transform: none; }
            .hamburger { display: flex; }
            .topbar { padding: 0 14px; gap: 10px; }
            .main { padding: 16px 14px 48px; }
            .detail { gap: 16px; }
            /* 窄屏没有 hover，操作按钮常驻 —— 否则会白占一行高度 */
            .server-actions { opacity: 1; gap: 8px; }
            /* 触屏上放大命中区（桌面端保留紧凑尺寸） */
            .server-action-btn { width: 44px; height: 44px; font-size: 14px; }
            .book-action-btn { width: 32px; height: 32px; font-size: 12px; }
            .server-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
            .usage-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .doc-books { gap: 12px; }
            .deploy-toolbar { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
            .deploy-detail-panel { margin-left: 0; }
            .hero-mini-name { font-size: 16px; }
            .mini-note { display: none; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .sd-tab { padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 12px; }
            .sd-tab-count { display: none; }
            .metric-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .log-row { grid-template-columns: 62px 48px; row-gap: 4px; }
            .log-msg { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
            .disk-item { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 78px; }
        }
        @media (max-width: 560px) {
            .kpi-bar { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .server-detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .ops-card-body-inner { padding: 14px; }
            .server-row { grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: 10px; }
            .server-actions { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
            .modal-actions { flex-direction: column-reverse; }
            .modal-actions .btn { justify-content: center; }
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            *, *::before, *::after {
                animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
